        "note": "Formalizes three results of Ono's paper (the kernel divisibility theorem, the proximity lemma for E, and #(E ∩ [1, N]) = O(log N)). Per the paper's Appendix A, the growth estimate of Lemma 2.3 was not included there, so the \"x_n ∉ Z for n ≥ n₀, n ∉ E\" half of Corollary 1.2 was not formalized; this entry supplies it with n₀ = 5. No code from it is used; formal-conjectures takes its definitions of A, B and x from it.",
